<title>ESTONIA: TALLINN WATER TO ISSUE NEW CPS.</title>
<headline>TALLINN WATER TO ISSUE NEW CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinn Water and Sewage Company will issue new commercial papers worth 50 million kroons on May 6, Hansapank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The yield on the three-month commercial paper is 7.48 percent, Ulo Kallas, interest products manager with the bank, told Reuters.</p>
<p>Kallas added that Tallinn Water and Sewage Company will issue more CPs in mid-May and that Hansa Liising would also tap the market at that time.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
